{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西總統盧拉周日（25日）擊敗前總統博索納羅之子弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro），成功連任。</p><p>選舉法院宣布，盧拉以51.76%得票擊敗48.24%的弗拉維奧。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.012453+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T00:31:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.254928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536448+00:00","content_hash":"6367c5ff336c5c6be0175cf6a37e3bb154b7522242fdd61e07310a7809fd85d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}